      <div type="commentary">
        <p n="1" ana="#tr.print">The framed manuscript page number [ⲓⲑ] is printed with a bar above and below as the frame, not as a supralinear stroke.</p>
        <p n="6" ana="#tr.print">The dot under ⲣ stands left of its descender.</p>
